        <fullName>Credit_Assessment_16jg5000000zUu1</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Handles all credit-assessment tasks for a loan applicant: retrieving the applicant&apos;s profile and credit data, and answering questions about lending policy — thresholds, ratios (DSCR, ICR), eligibility, security, and responsible-lending rules — whether asked standalone or while preparing a credit memo. Route any question about credit policy, lending criteria, an applicant&apos;s profile, or a loan&apos;s assessment here. Drafts memo evidence for the analyst; never issues an approve/decline verdict.</description>
