            <description>Runs a credit bureau (Equifax CRI) enquiry for a Loan Application. Stores the result as a new immutable Credit Check marked as the latest, marks any previous check as no longer latest, and records the access in the credit audit log. Use this when a credit score or bureau file is needed for an application and there is no current check, or when a fresh pull has been asked for.</description>
